PaymentRails_PreviewExecution
├── when token is zero address
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroTokenAddress
├── when no action is configured
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_NoActionConfigured
├── when token is not enabled
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_TokenNotEnabled
├── when module has no code
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_InvalidModule
├── when balance is zero
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_ZeroAmount
├── when balance is below minBalance
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRails_BelowMinimumBalance
├── when module validation fails
│   └── it should revert with the module's reason string
└── when all checks pass
    ├── it should return estimated output from module
    └── it should return output token from module
